<title>GREECE: Greek Xiosbank cuts savings, mortgage rates.</title>
<headline>Greek Xiosbank cuts savings, mortgage rates.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Greece's private Xiosbank said it cut its base savings rate to 8.5 percent from 9.0 percent and its mortgage rate to 14 percent from 15.</p>
<p>It also cut its Xiosbank Visa card rate by 150 basis points to 24 percent. --Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
